==Old English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ang|ƿyrd||wynn spelling}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*wurdiz}}, from {{inh|ang|ine-pro|*wrti-}}, a verbal abstract from the root {{m|ine-pro|*wert-||to turn}} (whence {{cog|la|vertere}}), related to the Old English verb {{m|ang|weorþan||to grow into, become}} (compare {{cog|nl|worden}}, {{cog|de|werden}}). Cognate with {{cog|osx|wurd}}, {{cog|goh|wurt}}, {{cog|non|urðr}}.

